<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title><c:out value="${title}"/> · Workhub</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/app.css"><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/reports.js" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">본문으로</a><div class="shell"><aside><a class="brand" href="${ctx}/reports">W<span>Workhub<small>회계 · 리스크 보고공간</small></span></a><details class="business-navigation" open><summary>주요 업무 메뉴 <span class="badge">${businessMenuCount}</span></summary><label class="menu-search-label">메뉴 찾기<input id="menu-search" type="search" placeholder="예: 채권, 위험, 예산" autocomplete="off"></label><nav class="report-nav" aria-label="50개 주요 업무 메뉴"><c:forEach items="${reportGroups}" var="group"><details class="menu-group" ${reportType.group == group.key ? 'open' : ''}><summary><c:out value="${group.key}"/> <small>5</small></summary><c:forEach items="${group.value}" var="item"><a class="business-menu ${reportType.code == item.code ? 'selected' : ''}" href="${ctx}/reports/${item.code}"><c:out value="${item.title}"/></a></c:forEach></details></c:forEach></nav><p id="menu-empty" hidden>일치하는 메뉴가 없습니다.</p></details><details class="utility-tools"><summary>기존 업무·관리 도구</summary><a class="button" href="${ctx}/reports">보고센터 전체 보기</a><nav class="utility-nav" aria-label="보조 업무 도구"><a href="${ctx}/dashboard">◫ 대시보드</a><a href="${ctx}/projects">▤ 프로젝트</a><a href="${ctx}/tasks">✓ 업무</a><a href="${ctx}/clients">▦ 거래처</a><a href="${ctx}/approvals">↗ 내 승인요청</a><c:if test="${manager}"><a href="${ctx}/inbox">▣ 승인함</a></c:if><a href="${ctx}/notices">◉ 공지사항</a><c:if test="${admin}"><div class="nav-label">ADMINISTRATION</div><a href="${ctx}/users">사용자 관리</a><a href="${ctx}/departments">부서 관리</a><a href="${ctx}/audit">감사로그</a></c:if></nav></details><div class="aside-foot">함께 만드는 더 나은 업무 흐름<br>WORKHUB · REPORTS</div></aside><div class="workspace"><header><span>회계·리스크 보고센터</span><div class="account"><a href="${ctx}/profile"><c:out value="${username}"/> · 내 정보</a><form action="${ctx}/logout" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><button class="quiet">로그아웃</button></form></div></header><main id="main"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">WORKSPACE / <c:out value="${title}"/></div><h1><c:out value="${title}"/></h1></div><span class="workspace-badge">● 연결된 업무</span></div><c:if test="${param.saved != null}"><div class="alert success" role="status">변경사항을 저장했습니다.</div></c:if><c:if test="${param.deleted != null}"><div class="alert success" role="status">자료를 삭제했습니다.</div></c:if>